{"4728500": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Something on the Floor", "steam_appid": 4728500, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Something on the Floor</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sudden blackout struck an ordinary hotel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the power came back on, everyone was gone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the caretaker, you enter the hotel to search for the missing people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the floors of this place repeat endlessly,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and somewhere inside, something is definitely there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4728500/extras/90be33ff086d88570d53f5417815dae0.poster.avif?t=1780880175\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4728500/extras/90be33ff086d88570d53f5417815dae0.webm?t=1780880175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4728500/extras/90be33ff086d88570d53f5417815dae0.mp4?t=1780880175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive the Repeating Hotel</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>『Something on the Floor』</strong> is a story-driven anomaly horror game where you explore endlessly repeating hotel floors, find anomalies, and choose the correct escape route to move on to the next floor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each floor hides changes that were not there before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find what has changed, understand the rules of the hotel, and continue deeper into its repeating floors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you handle an anomaly incorrectly,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >or choose the wrong path—</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the hotel will begin to remember your mistakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4728500/extras/11bd3184e59f026b73e0fd91c15d58f8.poster.avif?t=1780880175\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4728500/extras/11bd3184e59f026b73e0fd91c15d58f8.webm?t=1780880175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4728500/extras/11bd3184e59f026b73e0fd91c15d58f8.mp4?t=1780880175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Anomalies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the repeating floors, anything that has changed from its usual state is an anomaly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anomalies may appear as tiny, subtle differences, or in forms that are impossible to ignore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe your surroundings carefully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find what is wrong, deal with it in the correct way, and move on to the next floor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4728500/extras/49cb5bc14b9671fd412ebbcaf44ef21e.poster.avif?t=1780880175\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4728500/extras/49cb5bc14b9671fd412ebbcaf44ef21e.webm?t=1780880175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4728500/extras/49cb5bc14b9671fd412ebbcaf44ef21e.mp4?t=1780880175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4728500/extras/c5187d4e368f32831964d25f44908be3.avif?t=1780880175\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4728500/extras_big/c5187d4e368f32831964d25f44908be3.webp?t=1780880175 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Escape Routes</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each floor contains three escape routes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must choose the route that fits the situation in order to reach the next floor safely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elevator, stairs, emergency exit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even on the same floor, the safe path changes every time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you made the wrong choice, do not hesitate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4728500/extras/37e59465246f23b404898fc962151445.poster.avif?t=1780880175\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4728500/extras/37e59465246f23b404898fc962151445.webm?t=1780880175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4728500/extras/37e59465246f23b404898fc962151445.mp4?t=1780880175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Hotel’s Secret</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you repeat the game, collect torn pieces of notes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These notes record what happened in this hotel, and why you were left behind here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>『Something on the Floor』</strong> features three main endings, as well as a true ending that can only be reached after collecting every clue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4728500/extras/d680adf5575cec3cb439b0376e11501a.poster.avif?t=1780880175\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4728500/extras/d680adf5575cec3cb439b0376e11501a.webm?t=1780880175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4728500/extras/d680adf5575cec3cb439b0376e11501a.mp4?t=1780880175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observation-based horror gameplay where you find anomalies in repeating hotel floors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three escape routes that must be chosen depending on the situation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A threatening presence that reacts to wrong choices and certain conditions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story collection through torn note fragments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three main endings and one true ending</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story mode lasting approximately 1–2 hours</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bonus Modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even after you complete Story Mode, the hotel does not end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various bonus modes are prepared, twisting the rules of the main game in different ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience Infinity Mode, where you test your survival in endlessly repeating floors,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speedrun Mode, made for players who have fully mastered the hotel’s rules,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and special modes that let you enjoy the hotel in completely different ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes, instead of running away, you may need to stand your ground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes, the developer may appear inside the hotel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And in one particular mode,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the hotel is ruled by cats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do not ask why.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4728500/extras/7cc1bb4eb2b0a30845d5231d1d0b45ad.poster.avif?t=1780880175\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4728500/extras/7cc1bb4eb2b0a30845d5231d1d0b45ad.webm?t=1780880175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4728500/extras/7cc1bb4eb2b0a30845d5231d1d0b45ad.mp4?t=1780880175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wishlist</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlisting</strong> the game is a huge help to the developer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on wishlist milestones, we plan to expand the game through free updates, including secret rooms, hidden endings, special modes, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Understand the rules of the repeating hotel, follow the traces of the missing people,</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>and uncover the true reason you were left behind.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Something on the Floor</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sudden blackout struck an ordinary hotel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the power came back on, everyone was gone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the caretaker, you enter the hotel to search for the missing people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the floors of this place repeat endlessly,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and somewhere inside, something is definitely there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4728500/extras/90be33ff086d88570d53f5417815dae0.poster.avif?t=1780880175\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4728500/extras/90be33ff086d88570d53f5417815dae0.webm?t=1780880175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4728500/extras/90be33ff086d88570d53f5417815dae0.mp4?t=1780880175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive the Repeating Hotel</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>『Something on the Floor』</strong> is a story-driven anomaly horror game where you expl